# Pong Game v1.0

A simple Pong game implemented in JavaScript using HTML5 Canvas.

## Overview

This is a browser-based implementation of the classic Pong game. It features two-player paddle controls, a bouncing ball, score tracking, and game pause functionality. The game dynamically adjusts to the canvas size.

## Features

- Smooth paddle movement with continuous key press support
- Ball collision with paddles and walls
- Scoring system and automatic pause after each point
- Fully responsive canvas for width/height changes
- Self documented code structure using a Model-View-Controller pattern
- JSDoc comments for documentation

## Controls

| Player           | Keys                       |
| ---------------- | -------------------------- |
| Left Paddle      | `W` (up), `S` (down)       |
| Right Paddle     | `P` (up), `L` (down)       |
| Start / New Game | `N` or `R` (Not specified) |

## Installation

1. Clone or download the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/yourusername/pong-game.git
   ```
